  unitName: Omega Behemoth
  unitId: 40115
  unitNumber: 373
  description: Behemoth was born in an environment full of otherworldly power. Its
    internal drive to strengthen itself is the trait that separates this powerful
    magical beast apart from the others. Not only would it strengthen itself physically,
    but the otherworldly power held inside of it would evolve as well. Though in
    the process of evolving most of its body is destroyed, in its complete evolved
    form it is said to have the power to sink continents.
  summonDesc: Back away from me!<br>Or maybe I should turn<br>you to dust!!
  fusionDesc: Allow me to introduce you<br>to the destroyer of all!
  evoDesc: Hear me roar!<br>Fear my approaching footsteps!<br>Now is the time of
    destruction!
